
Property set operations.
USAGE:

SET <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

The following writeable properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
DefaultLimit                       	uint64              	Read/Write
DefaultWarningLimit                	uint64              	Read/Write
ExceededNotification               	boolean             	Read/Write
State                              	uint32              	Read/Write
VolumePath                         	string              	Read/Write
WarningExceededNotification        	boolean             	Read/Write

